  "text": "### Findings\n\n- **Blocker** \u2014 `packages/excalidraw/actions/actionProperties.test.tsx:254`: U21 tests for the arrowhead size properties panel control, mixed multi-selection state, undo/redo history, and arrow-to-arrow style copy/paste were not applied (leaving AC-4, AC-5, and AC-8 untested) because `UI.createElement(\"arrow\")` with default `size = 10` falls below `MINIMUM_ARROW_SIZE` and leaves `appState.multiElement` active, blocking undo. Fix: add the U21 tests using `UI.createElement(\"arrow\", { size: 100 })` for the undo/redo test and `API.executeAction(actionCopyStyles)` / `API.executeAction(actionPasteStyles)` for style copy/paste.\n\n### Passing Checks\n\n- Correctness & Spec compliance: U01\u2013U20, U22, and U23 match `change_plan.md`.\n- Type safety: `yarn test:typecheck` passed with 0 errors; `ExcalidrawLinearElement[\"arrowheadSize\"]` is properly typed and narrowed.\n- Error handling & sanitization: `restore.ts` validates finite positive `arrowheadSize` and strips invalid/non-linear values; `delta.ts` and `actionStyles.ts` delete `arrowheadSize` when reverted/cleared to `undefined`.\n- Code quality & tests: `yarn test:code` and `yarn test:app` passed across all applied units.",
